{
  "_readme": [
    "Breaks recognised as surf spots, by country and region.",
    "",
    "This list carries NO coordinates on purpose. Coordinates stay traceable to",
    "OpenStreetMap; this file only says which of the catalogued places is a surf",
    "spot, so it decides two things and nothing else:",
    "  1. a named break survives the filter even if its exposure arc is narrow",
    "  2. inside a cluster of places that share the same forecast cell, the named",
    "     break is the one that represents it",
    "",
    "Names are matched loosely against OpenStreetMap names within the same region",
    "(accents, articles and the words beach/playa/platja/plage/praia ignored).",
    "Entries with no match are reported by scripts/curate-spots.mjs and are simply",
    "not in the catalogue: nothing is invented from this file."
  ],
